{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076540/extras/9981881200d306465ef93f2436b4cd7f.avif?t=1759941508\" data-has-big width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invasion Survivors is a bullet heaven with roguelike mechanics for those who love challenges.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, choose a character, pick a weapon, and set the difficulty. Each run features 12 waves lasting 30 to 70 seconds, becoming harder over time. Buy and upgrade your weapons and items between rounds, grow stronger, and prove that you are the true survivor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >29 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 elite boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for 33 languages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076540/extras/d00f3851e51546644c1c441663bc184b.poster.avif?t=1759941508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076540/extras/d00f3851e51546644c1c441663bc184b.webm?t=1759941508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076540/extras/d00f3851e51546644c1c441663bc184b.mp4?t=1759941508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, upgrade, and grow stronger</p><p class=